<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA LEAD RUSSIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA LEAD RUSSIA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa led Russia 2-0 after</p>
<p>completion of the rain-affected second singles match in their</p>
<p>Davis Cup World Group first round tie on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results (South Africa names first):</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat Andrei Chesnokov (Russia)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 6-3 3-6 4-6 7-5 (played Friday)</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3 3-6 4-6 8-6</p>
</text>
